      </div>
      <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On treatments:</strong> Untreated Rubies are rare, the most valuable, and strongly preferred for astrological use. Heat-treated stones are stable and acceptable when fully disclosed. Glass-filled, lead-filled, or diffusion-treated stones are never acceptable — we do not carry them. Colour fading over time is a direct red flag for poor or unstable treatment.</p>
      </div>
    {%- when 'yellow-sapphire' -%}
      <p>Yellow Sapphire sits at Mohs 9 on the hardness scale, making it one of the most durable gemstones available and well suited to daily wear. It asks only for basic, consistent care.</p>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
        <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
          <h4 style="color: #1a3c34; margin-bottom: 10px;"> Do's</h4>
          <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Clean with a soft cloth after wear.</li>
            <li>Use lukewarm water and a drop of mild soap occasionally.</li>
            <li>Store separately in a padded box.</li>
            <li>Wear on the index finger if astrologically advised.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
          <h4 style="color: #c53030; margin-bottom: 10px;"> Don'ts</h4>
          <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>Avoid harsh chemicals, perfumes, and detergents.</li>
            <li>Never use ultrasonic or steam cleaning.</li>
            <li>Avoid extreme heat and sudden temperature changes.</li>
            <li>Remove during gym, manual work, or contact sports.</li>
