      <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
        <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On treatments:</strong> Untreated Yellow Sapphires are the most valuable and strongly preferred for astrological use. Heat-treated stones are stable and acceptable when fully disclosed. Diffusion-treated and glass-filled stones are never acceptable. Colour fading over time is a red flag for unstable treatment — colour stability must always be confirmed before purchase.</p>
      </div>
    {%- when 'white-sapphire' -%}
      <div class="gem-care">
        <p>White Sapphire ranks 9 on the Mohs scale, making it highly durable and suitable for daily wear. Its defining quality is clarity, so care focuses on preserving its clean, luminous surface.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
          <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #1a3c34; margin-bottom: 10px;">Do</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Clean gently with a soft, lint-free cloth after wear.</li>
              <li>Use lukewarm water with mild soap occasionally.</li>
              <li>Store separately in a padded box.</li>
              <li>Check settings regularly for secure wear.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #c53030; margin-bottom: 10px;">Avoid</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
