              <li>Extreme heat or sudden temperature changes.</li>
              <li>Gym sessions, manual work, or storing with harder stones like diamonds.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On treatments:</strong> Untreated White Sapphires are preferred for astrological use. Heat-treated stones are stable and acceptable when fully disclosed. Glass filling, coating, or dyeing are never acceptable. Any persistent cloudiness should be evaluated — surface haze is usually removable, but internal dullness may signal poor quality or treatment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- when 'red-coral' -%}
      <div class="gem-care">
        <p>Red Coral is an organic gemstone — formed from marine life, not mined from the earth. It is softer and more porous than crystalline stones, and care should reflect that difference. Gentleness is not optional with Moonga — it is essential.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
          <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #1a3c34; margin-bottom: 10px;">Do</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Wipe gently with a soft, dry cloth after every wear — this is the single most important habit.</li>
              <li>Clean occasionally with a lightly damp cloth, then dry immediately and completely.</li>
              <li>Store separately in a padded, fabric-lined box.</li>
              <li>Ensure the setting is secure; check prongs regularly.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #c53030; margin-bottom: 10px;">Avoid</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Soaking in water; perfumes, lotions, oils, sweat, and chemicals.</li>
              <li>Ultrasonic, steam, or chemical cleaning.</li>
              <li>Heat and prolonged direct sunlight.</li>
              <li>Remove before gym sessions, swimming, manual work, or contact sports.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On treatments:</strong> Only natural, untreated coral is suitable for astrological use. Dyed, reconstructed, resin-filled, or imitation coral should be avoided entirely. We carry only natural coral with full treatment transparency and independent certification.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- when 'pearl' -%}
      <div class="gem-care">
        <p>Pearl is an organic gemstone and softer than the crystalline stones in this collection. It does not ask for complicated care — but it does ask for gentleness, and it will show the difference between a wearer who respects that and one who does not.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
          <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #1a3c34; margin-bottom: 10px;">Do</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Wipe with a soft, dry cloth after every wear — this single habit preserves lustre more than anything else.</li>
              <li>Put Pearl on after applying perfumes, lotions, or makeup, never before.</li>
              <li>Store separately in a soft pouch or padded box away from harder stones.</li>
              <li>Clean lightly with a damp cloth only when needed, then dry immediately.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #c53030; margin-bottom: 10px;">Avoid</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Soaking in water; perfumes, cosmetics, hairspray, oils, and chemicals.</li>
              <li>Ultrasonic or steam cleaning.</li>
              <li>Prolonged heat or direct sunlight.</li>
              <li>Remove before sleeping, swimming, gym sessions, or any manual activity.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On long-term wear:</strong> A gradual, subtle softening of lustre over years is natural for an organic gem and does not reduce astrological effectiveness — only the authenticity of the pearl determines that. Dyed or imitation pearls deteriorate significantly faster. Minor surface marks are natural; deep cracks, peeling, or flaky texture are not.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- when 'hessonite' -%}
      <div class="gem-care">
        <p>Hessonite is a durable garnet and well suited to regular wear with basic mindfulness. Its defining quality — inner warmth and glow — is best preserved through consistent, gentle care.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
          <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #1a3c34; margin-bottom: 10px;">Do</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Wipe with a soft cloth after wear.</li>
              <li>Clean occasionally with mild soap and lukewarm water, then dry thoroughly before storing.</li>
              <li>Store separately in a padded box; ensure the setting is secure.</li>
              <li>Wear in the advised metal and remove before high-impact activities.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #c53030; margin-bottom: 10px;">Avoid</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Harsh chemicals, acids, and detergents.</li>
              <li>Ultrasonic or steam cleaning.</li>
              <li>Strong impact or dropping the stone — like all gemstones, Hessonite can crack with significant force.</li>
              <li>Storing with harder stones; remove before gym or heavy physical activity.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On natural inclusions:</strong> Minor inclusions are normal and expected in natural Hessonite. Overall warmth and glow matter far more than technical flawlessness. Minor surface dulling over time can be professionally polished. Always insist on treatment disclosure — it is non-negotiable for a stone worn for Rahu.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- when 'cats-eye' -%}
      <div class="gem-care">
        <p>Chrysoberyl Cat's Eye is durable, but its defining feature — the sharpness of the eye — depends directly on the quality of the surface polish. Protecting that surface is the primary care priority.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
          <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #1a3c34; margin-bottom: 10px;">Do</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Wipe gently with a soft cloth after wear.</li>
              <li>Clean occasionally with mild soap and lukewarm water, then dry thoroughly.</li>
              <li>Store separately in a padded box.</li>
              <li>Ensure the setting is secure, particularly in rings worn daily.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #c53030; margin-bottom: 10px;">Avoid</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Harsh chemicals, acids, and detergents.</li>
