        <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On the eye over time:</strong> Surface scratches can dull or weaken the sharpness of the eye — this is the primary thing to protect against. Professional polishing can restore eye definition when needed. Quartz Cat's Eye wears faster than Chrysoberyl and requires more attentive care.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- when 'amethyst' -%}
      <div class="gem-care">
        <p>Amethyst is durable at Mohs 7 and straightforward to maintain. Its primary vulnerability is prolonged heat and strong direct sunlight, which can gradually lighten the colour over time — the single most important thing to protect against.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
          <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #1a3c34; margin-bottom: 10px;">Do</h4>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;">
              <li>Wipe with a soft cloth after wear.</li>
              <li>Clean occasionally with mild soap and lukewarm water, then dry immediately.</li>
              <li>Store separately in a padded box in a cool, dark location.</li>
              <li>Check settings regularly.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div style="background: #fff5f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <h4 style="color: #c53030; margin-bottom: 10px;">Avoid</h4>
