        </div>
        <div style="background: #fdfaf5; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold); margin-top: 20px;">
          <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>On colour stability:</strong> Natural Amethyst is colour-stable under ordinary wear and indoor conditions. It is sustained exposure to heat — not normal daily use — that poses a risk. Stored and worn with basic care, it holds its colour reliably for years.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- when 'citrine' -%}
      <div class="gem-care">
        <p>Citrine is a durable quartz gemstone and one of the more straightforward stones to maintain. Like Amethyst, its primary vulnerability is prolonged exposure to heat or strong direct sunlight, which can gradually lighten the colour. Ordinary daily wear does not pose this risk.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
